  1	# Product
  2	
  3	<!-- impeccable:product-schema 1 -->
  4	
  5	## Platform
  6	
  7	web
  8	
  9	## Users
 10	Technical recruiters, hiring managers, and engineering peers looking for a memorable, immersive showcase of Nick Borrello's engineering skills, projects, and background.
 11	
 12	## Product Purpose
 13	A personal engineering portfolio for Nicholas Borrello — AI Engineer — where visitors immediately see who he is, what systems he builds, his strongest measured outcomes, featured case studies with visuals, a readable career timeline, proof-backed capabilities, and direct contact. The NieR: Automata-inspired identity survives as atmosphere; the engineering work is the content.
 14	
 15	## Positioning
 16	A scrollable engineering portfolio that carries a restrained NieR: Automata field-UI identity (beige/charcoal palette, Rajdhani HUD lettering, fine grid texture, hairline frames, small technical annotations) while keeping the engineering work unmistakably the main character. The game-menu interaction model is retired: no boot sequence, no tab shell, no fake system metadata — content is immediately readable and evidence is the proof.
 17	
 18	## Operating Context
 19	Web browsers across desktop and mobile viewports. Designed to deliver an immediate "wow" factor for developers and gamers while providing clear, efficient navigation for recruiters skimming candidate details.
 20	
 21	## Capabilities and Constraints
 22	- **Document Portfolio IA**: Hero (identity + proof metrics) → Featured case studies (Resumancer, Baystate AI pipeline, ShopSite-MCP) → Experience timeline (employment + education separated) → Capabilities (proof-backed, no tiers) → About/contact.
 23	- **Restrained NieR Styling**: warm beige ground, charcoal ink, hairline borders, fine grid mesh in hero/header/divider strips only, Rajdhani display type, one muted machine-red accent for links/focus/status.
 24	- **Proof-Backed Interaction**: capability chips reveal 1–4 real usage examples tied to named projects/roles (single-example chips trace to their one true shipping context); page remains fully understandable without interaction.
 25	- **Tech Stack**: React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Lucide icons, Tailwind CSS (build-pipeline, no CDN) with the NieR palette (`#ded8c1`, `#cfc9b0`, `#4b4845`, `#3a3836`, `#575451`, `#a19d8a`) plus accent `#8c3a2c`.
 26	- **Data Architecture**: Structured static data in `data.ts` / `types.ts` with separate work-experience, education, capability, and project models; live screenshots of Resumancer in `public/work/`.
 27	
 28	## Brand Commitments
 29	- **Name**: Nicholas Borrello
 30	- **Visual Universe**: NieR: Automata field UI as seasoning (Square Enix)
 31	- **Palette**: Nier Beige (`#ded8c1`), Dim Beige (`#cfc9b0`), Nier Dark (`#4b4845`), Darker (`#3a3836`), Panel (`#575451`), Grid (`#a19d8a`), accent `#8c3a2c`
 32	- **Typography**: Rajdhani (Tech HUD headers), Inter (Body text)
 33	
 34	## Evidence on Hand
 35	- Real project, experience, education, and capability data documented in `data.ts` with proof traces
 36	- Live Resumancer product captures in `public/work/`; authored architecture diagrams in `components/diagrams/`
 37	- All metrics trace to documented achievements; dead URLs are omitted from shipped links
 38	
 39	## Product Principles
 40	1. **Evidence first**: Engineering outcomes, case studies, and proof-backed capabilities outrank decoration; every metric and link must be real and defensible.
 41	2. **Immediate comprehension**: A visitor answers who Nick is, what he builds, his role, his strongest proof, and how to contact him without clicking anything.
 42	3. **NieR as seasoning, not structure**: The beige/charcoal HUD identity survives as atmosphere; the page behaves like a normal responsive document with standard navigation, scrolling, and semantics.
 43	
 44	## Accessibility & Inclusion
 45	Maintain contrast between dark text (`#3a3836`/`#4b4845`) and beige background (`#ded8c1`); standard keyboard navigation through semantic links, visible focus states, `prefers-reduced-motion` support, and skip-to-content.

