 17	  --font-tech: "Rajdhani", "Inter", sans-serif;
 18	  --font-sans: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
 19	}
 20	
 21	/* ------- Base ------- */
 22	
 23	html {
 24	  scroll-behavior: smooth;
 25	}
 26	
 27	body {
 28	  background-color: var(--color-nier-beige);
 29	  color: var(--color-nier-darker);
 30	  font-family: var(--font-sans);
 31	  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
 32	  padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
 33	  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
 34	  padding-left: env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px);
 35	  padding-right: env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px);
 36	  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
 37	}
 38	
 39	::selection {
 40	  background: var(--color-nier-darker);
 41	  color: var(--color-nier-beige);
 42	}
 43	
 44	/* ------- Focus visibility ------- */
 45	
 46	:focus-visible {
 47	  outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
 48	  outline-offset: 2px;
 49	  border-radius: 2px;
 50	}
 51	
 52	/* ------- Scrollbar (quiet, world-toned) ------- */
 53	
 54	::-webkit-scrollbar {
 55	  width: 10px;
 56	}
 57	::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
 58	  background: var(--color-nier-beige);
 59	}
 60	::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
 61	  background: var(--color-nier-grid);
 62	  border: 3px solid var(--color-nier-beige);
 63	  border-radius: 0;
 64	}
 65	::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
 66	  background: var(--color-nier-dark);
 67	}
 68	
 69	/* ------- Texture: fine field mesh, zones only ------- */
 70	/* impeccable-disable-next-line codex-grid-background: brief-pinned NieR field texture (issue #2 "Keep: subtle grid / technical texture"); zone-limited per DESIGN.md, never a viewport overlay */
 71	@utility mesh {
 72	  background-image:
 73	    linear-gradient(rgba(58, 56, 54, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
 74	    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(58, 56, 54, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
 75	  background-size: 3px 3px;
 76	}
 77	
 78	@utility mesh-strong {
 79	  background-image:
 80	    linear-gradient(rgba(58, 56, 54, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
 81	    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(58, 56, 54, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
 82	  background-size: 3px 3px;
 83	}
 84	
 85	/* ------- Motion ------- */
 86	
 87	@utility rise-in {
 88	  animation: rise-in 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
 89	}
 90	
 91	@keyframes rise-in {
 92	  from {
 93	    opacity: 0;
 94	    transform: translateY(10px);
 95	  }
 96	  to {
 97	    opacity: 1;
 98	    transform: translateY(0);
 99	  }
100	}
101	
102	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
103	  html {
104	    scroll-behavior: auto;
105	  }
106	  *,
107	  *::before,
108	  *::after {
109	    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
110	    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
111	    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
112	  }
113	}
  1	# Nicholas Borrello — AI Engineer Portfolio
  2	
  3	A scrollable engineering portfolio with a restrained NieR: Automata field-UI identity — beige/charcoal palette, Rajdhani HUD lettering, fine grid texture, hairline frames. The engineering work is the main character; the game-menu interaction model was retired in the 2026 redesign (issue #2).
  4	
  5	## Stack
  6	
  7	- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite (bundled — no CDN runtime dependencies)
  8	- Tailwind CSS v4 (build pipeline via `@tailwindcss/vite`, tokens in `index.css`)
  9	- Lucide icons
 10	
 11	## Run locally
 12	
 13	```bash
 14	npm install
 15	npm run dev      # http://localhost:3000
 16	npm run build    # production build → dist/
 17	npm run preview  # serve the production build
 18	```
 19	
 20	## Content
 21	
 22	All portfolio content lives in `data.ts` (projects, experience, education, capabilities with proof traces, contacts). Every metric and capability chip traces to a real claim there. Visuals: live Resumancer captures in `public/work/`, authored architecture diagrams in `components/diagrams/`.
 23	
 24	## Before deploying
 25	
 26	- Add your resume at `public/resume.pdf` (the Resume CTAs link to it).
 27	- The social preview card is `public/og-card.png` (1200×630); regenerate from `/tmp/og-card.html` if the hero copy changes.
